{"title":"Editorial Clean & Elegant","body":"<div style=\"background-color: #f4f3f6; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Georgia', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">\n    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 620px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(74, 29, 92, 0.08); border: 1px solid #e9e5ec; border-collapse: separate;\">\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #4a1d5c; padding: 35px 40px; text-align: left;\">\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n                            <img src=\"media/com_wmacommunication/images/logo-wma-email.png\" alt=\"WMA Software Development\" width=\"160\" style=\"display: block; border: 0;\" />\n                        </td>\n                        <td align=\"right\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #fbebe8; font-weight: 700; background: rgba(224, 86, 56, 0.3); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px;\">Modulo Contatto</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n                <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 25px 0 0 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2;\">Nuova Candidatura / Messaggio</h1>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 35px 40px 40px 40px;\">\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #faf8fb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; border-left: 3px solid #e05638;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #6b5b75; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                            <strong>Pagina di origine:</strong> {Titolo articolo}<br />\n                            <strong>URL:</strong> <a href=\"{URL pagina}\" style=\"color: #4a1d5c; text-decoration: underline;\">{URL pagina}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #4a1d5c; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4a1d5c; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700;\">Dati del Mittente</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 12px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Nome e Cognome</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #2a1533; font-weight: 600;\">{Nome} {Cognome}</span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 12px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Telefono</span>\n                            <a href=\"tel:{Telefono}\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #2a1533; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">{Telefono}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Indirizzo Email</span>\n                            <a href=\"mailto:{Email}\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #e05638; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">{Email}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #4a1d5c; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4a1d5c; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700;\">Dettagli Candidatura</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 12px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Oggetto</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #2a1533; font-weight: 500;\">{Oggetto}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 12px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Tipologia & Posizione</span>\n                            <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbebe8; color: #e05638; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; margin-right: 8px;\">{Tipo di candidatura}</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #2a1533; font-weight: 600;\">{Posizioni aperte}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Curriculum Vitae</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4a1d5c; font-weight: 600;\">📎 {Allega curriculum}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #4a1d5c; padding-bottom: 6px;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4a1d5c; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 700;\">Messaggio</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #2a1533; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 10px 0;\">\n                    {Messaggio}\n                </div>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px dashed #e9e5ec; font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; text-align: right;\">\n                            hCaptcha: <strong>{hcaptcha}</strong>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; padding: 25px; font-size: 11px; color: #8c7b95; background-color: #faf8fb; border-top: 1px solid #e9e5ec; text-align: center;\">\n                Email generata dal form di contatto di <strong>WMA Software Development</strong>.\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>"}
